.Dd November 18, 2026
.Dt LSBLK 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm lsblk
.Nd list block devices and GPT partitions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl n
.Op Ar device ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility queries the
.Dq block:
scheme for each device and prints its size and GPT partitions.
With no operands it probes
.Ql block:0
through
.Ql block:7
and skips absent devices.
An explicitly named device that cannot be opened is an error.
The
.Fl n
option suppresses the header.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 when at least one device was listed.
Returns 1 when no device was found or a named device failed.
Returns 2 on usage errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr gpart 1 ,
.Xr newfs 1
